{
    "background_story": "In the misty mountains of Asia, there lived a majestic bird named Colt, a male tragopan with iridescent feathers and a haunting call. Colt was known for his striking appearance and elusive nature, rarely seen by humans. However, his life took a dramatic turn when a devastating forest fire ravaged his habitat. Colt's home was destroyed, and he was forced to flee. With his vibrant plumage singed and his spirit shaken, he struggled to adapt to his new surroundings. Despite the tragedy, Colt's resilience and determination inspired the other birds in the area. He became a symbol of hope and perseverance, reminding all that even in the face of adversity, beauty and life can still thrive.",
